# This deployment is the static frontend only (see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md) --
# ignore the Python backend, R, VBA, tests, and data so Vercel's zero-config
# detection doesn't try to auto-build src/api.py as a serverless function.
#
# Every pattern is anchored to the repo root (leading "/") -- an unanchored
# pattern like "src/" or "data/" matches ANY directory with that name at ANY
# depth, which previously also matched (and deleted) frontend/src/ and
# frontend/public/data/, breaking the very build this file is meant to fix.
/src/
/data/
/db/
/r_analysis/
/vba/
/tests/
/scripts/
/benchmarks/
/docs/
/requirements.txt
/pytest.ini
/.venv/
